{"version":1,"content":"<p>韓星朱智勛與李鍾碩及申敏兒合作的韓劇《再婚皇后》正熱播，最新一期「最具話題韓劇榜」大執位。</p><p>《再》劇大熱空降No.1，金裕貞主演的話題劇《百日謊言》屈居第2位，女神金智媛擔正、翻拍自日本人氣醫療劇的韓劇《Doctor X：白色黑手黨時代》跌至</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.193714+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":121,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T04:49:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.083639+00:00","content_hash":"8e1529ac4bd57445b2d704f48036fde83d4b43eb922ccb26abb5bfa78c278bac","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}